BT /F1 10 Tf 40 750 Td 15 TL (FY2025 Enterprise Financial and Risk Brief) Tj T* (RELIANCE.NS Reliance Industries: Retail and digital services revenue grew 14 percent YoY. Key risk factors: crude refining margin volatility, telecom spectrum capex, and INR depreciation.) Tj T* (TCS.NS Tata Consultancy Services: Operating margin held at 26.1 percent driven by BFSI cloud deals. Key risk factors: North American discretionary IT spending delays and wage inflation.) Tj T* (INFY.NS Infosys: FY25 constant-currency revenue guidance raised to 4.5 to 5.0 percent on enterprise AI demand. Key risk factors: client budget tightening in Europe and attrition in specialized AI talent.) Tj T* (AAPL Apple Inc: Services revenue hit an all-time high with 2.2B active devices. Key risk factors: Greater China smartphone competition, supply-chain concentration, and App Store regulatory scrutiny.) Tj T* (MSFT Microsoft Corp: Azure and cloud services grew 31 percent YoY led by AI workloads. Key risk factors: elevated data center capital expenditure and enterprise cybersecurity liability.) Tj T* ET
